"P3451227796" "Percy Winkley is missing... again.<br><br>I feel like I've been doing this a lot recently, but he's worth two of any other Midnighter in our club. I need you to rescue <color deepskyblue>Percy Winkley</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P3894841947" "Rescue Percy Winkley"
// SendOffString :
"P1946082538" "Thank you for your assistance. He's been captured by the <color red>Circle of Thorns</color>. They're questioning him, trying to get him to reveal the Midnighter's secrets.<br><br><color orange>Find the Circle of Thorns cave and rescue Percy Winkley.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2645331088" "Rescue a Midnighter"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1289538206" "You need to go and find Percy before they get any information out of him. Please hurry."
