"P1898547991" "So, Montague sent {Hero} to come collect me.<em>Don't worry, I try not to make a habit out of this.<em>But you'll never believe what I found."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P569066044" "You've rescued the Midnighter known as Percy Winkley."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1326943524" "Thank you for rescuing Percy. He's already handed over information regarding the Circle. They're attempting to divert the flow of all power to only those who use magic, causing all other origins to weaken while magic users reach new heights of ability.<br><br>The Circle was doing this as a means to combat the <color red>Rikti's</color> encroachment into their caverns. This definitely explains their presence in those caves.<br><br>The <color deepskyblue>Midnight Squad</color> has this information. I'll know shortly how they wish to proceed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2928846313" "Ci'dion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1727096328" "The Midnighters believe that investigating Percy's information regarding the <color red>The Lost</color> and <color red>Rikti's</color> involvement with magic is now our primary concern. I don't know how Percy does it, but that kid's good.<br><br>Are you interested in aiding us in this venture?"
// AcceptString :
"P800342640" "Investigate the Lost and Rikti's involvement"
// SendOffString :
"P4208882901" "The Midnighters thank you for your assistance. Have you ever considered joining our fold?<br><br>We've determined they are using a nearby abandoned office, but we know not for what purpose.<br><br><color orange>You need to go into that office and collect any information you can regarding what they are doing.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3776379573" "Investigate Lost & Rikti"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P643483588" "We need you to go to that abandoned office and find out what the Lost and Rikti are doing there."
