// Dialog :
"P3249514119" "Ah, the Rikti and the Lost are working together. Not good.<br><br>Ever since the first invasion, the Midnighters have feared the Rikti would begin to pool their intellect towards countering their weakness to magic. If I had to guess, that's what's going on here."

