// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1764526616" "Surprisingly, we've managed to glean some information from the computer parts you've recovered. It looks like I've got another rescue operation for you, a very untraditional one at that."
// AcceptString :
"P1550155375" "Aid in rescue operation"
// SendOffString :
"P4005480085" "I need you to rescue a Rikti. Yes, you heard me right.<br><br>His name's <color deepskyblue>Argot'BurWot</color>, a Rikti Traditionalist being held captive by an opposing Rikti force, the Restructurists. I don't claim to be an expert on Rikti politics, but I do know that Argot has asked for asylum and the Vanguard have agreed to grant it to him. Since you found the intelligence, we thought you'd want to be the one who brought him in.<br><br><color orange>Rescue Argot'BurWot.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1293114368" "Rescue Argot'BurWot"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4149712698" "You need to track down the research facility where they are holding Argot'BurWot and rescue him."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2967923603" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1614502194" "The fact that there is such a thing as a 'good' Rikti seems odd, but if what Montague says is true, Argot'BurWot could hold the key to bringing them down."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P36881658" "<shout>Rikti defeat by {Hero}: Lucky shot."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1847876924" "<shout>{Hero}: Again. Unfinished business: Must settle scores."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - RiktiBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
