"P315926983" "Defeat Ci'dion & minions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P921306262" "You've defeated Ci'dion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Argot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3526343354" "Argot'BurWot"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2595548640" "Asylum: Synonym: Fatal choice"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3316921955" "Greetings, {Hero}.<em>English poorly translated.<em>I am thankful to rescue you.<em>I will follow you to exit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3753848493" "You've rescued Argot'BurWot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1381858509" "With Argot'BurWot safely in Vanguard hands, we have made a huge leap forward in this second invasion of the Rikti.<br><br>Now we only have to hope that the Vanguard are forthcoming with the intelligence they get out of our new Rikti ally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2444799287" "I think it's time we brought in some outside help.<br><br>You ever hear of the <color deepskyblue>Dawn Patrol</color>? Their original leader, <color deepskyblue>Hero 1</color>, was the one who took the Omega team through the Rikti Portal to shut it down. Ever since that day a woman by the name of <color deepskyblue>Lady Jane</color> has taken over the team. She's recently come over to the States and claims to have important information regarding the Lost. She wants a meeting."
// AcceptString :
"P1901455725" "Meet with Lady Jane"
// SendOffString :
"P694716811" "Apparently, the Lost attacked the main head quarters of the Dawn Patrol. The Patrol managed to fend off the group but a lot of damage was done.<br><br>You're supposed to meet up with Lady Jane. She doesn't want it widely known that she's here, fearing another possible Lost attack.<br><br><color orange>Go meet with Lady Jane and gather any knowledge she has regarding the Lost</color>.<br><br>Oh, and watch what you say about Hero 1 while talking to her. Rumor has it that they were more than just teammates."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P669337186" "Gather intelligence"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1181870659" "You need to find Lady Jane and get the information from her that she's brought with her from overseas."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2753106874" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3939557777" "You're here to meet up with Lady Jane and gather any information she has regarding the Lost."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1315840798" "Lady Jane"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3415756680" "I will use your soul as a battery..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P848187630" "Circle of Thorns Boss"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3651572303" "Shut up."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3412911296" "Get {HeroName}"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P3657480019" "Thanks for the help.<em t=6>Ever since Hero 1 disappeared, my team's been working on a way to defeat the Rikti.<em t=6>Solving that puzzle has led me here to collect an old relic."
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P1254090296" "<goto=Objective><f=Objective><em t=5>This is what I'm looking for. Now I just need to...<em batsmash t=3>Ah, there we go.<em none>Now what do we have here...<em>Interesting. I'll have to take this back to Dawn Patrol.<em>{Hero}, thanks for your help. I want you to have something. It should help you and the Midnighters."
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P961949366" "Not again."
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P1940852448" "Thanks again."
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P3658461534" "Now where did {HeroName} go?"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveText :
"P1391991686" "Help Lady Jane find chest"
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P1081046902" "<shout>Protect the chest"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - LadyJane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TreasureChest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P190579024" "Ancient Chest"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3108683416" "You begin opening the chest"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P152247694" "You have opened the chest"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3003981750" "Lady Jane has been defeated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P194926188" "You've rescued Lady Jane and collected the information you were seeking. Return to Montague for further instruction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3821466377" "Even though Lady Jane was defeated and forced to teleport away, she managed to give you a sample of blood from Hero 1. She claims that the blood comes from Hero 1 after he entered the Rikti Portal. I don't know how she got that, perhaps that's what she was trying to track down in the chest she was after.<br><br>There's also a data file regarding the research that Dawn Patrol was doing on the Lost.<br><br>This might be useful for our new friend Argot'BurWot.<br><br>Well done, {Hero}."
// RandomFameString :
"P3035874613" "Too bad about Lady Jane. I hear she's already on a flight back to England."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4119006925" "The vial Lady Jane gave you contains some of Hero 1's blood. She claims that the blood comes from Hero 1 after he entered the Rikti Portal. I don't know how she got that, perhaps that's what she was trying to track down in the chest she was after. Who knows?<br><br>There's also a data file regarding the research that Dawn Patrol was doing on the Lost.<br><br>This might be useful for our new friend Argot'BurWot.<br><br>Well done, {Hero}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2736026386" "I sent that vial of blood we got from Lady Jane over to the Rikti, Argot'BurWot. He said he would have a report about it pretty soon. I asked him to tell me what it was, but he said he would deal with you and you only.<br><br><color orange>You up for going to see Argot'BurWot?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P4074401233" "Agree to see Argot'BurWot"
// SendOffString :
"P2407955577" "He's in Atlas Park in one of the Vanguard compounds. This report must be important if he wants you to be the one to collect it."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P397691594" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2845313009" "Talk to Argot'BurWot"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3009546691" "You need to go to Atlas Park and find Argot'BurWot. Find out what he's discovered regarding the vial of blood collected from Hero 1.<br><br>You should be able to find Argot in the Vanguard compound they've got over in Atlas."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1998052252" "Thank you for coming to see me, {Hero}. I've made a very impressive breakthrough in both my language and my research. I wanted to make sure you were the first to experience me.<br><br>I have taken the vial of blood: from Montague. The blood is the cure for the Rikti virus in humans. In new words,<color orange> I discovered a cure for the Lost.</color><br><br>Recent humans are the only terms affected.<br><br> However, Rikti technological barriers still block virus. Magic: once again key. I've been reading local practitioners and one woman's name resonates within me.<br><br><color orange>I need you to take this to Azuria.</color><br><br> I believe she will be able to find a way over this problem."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4048120735" "Talk to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1677094184" "Please go and see Azuria. She will be able to aid us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1555840174" "Ah, it's been some time since I've seen you around these parts, {Hero}. What can I help you with?<br><br>A Rikti... on our side... trying to cure the Lost. That's impos... that's interesting. I would keep this knowledge to yourself. Many here would not believe you and if they did, there's no telling what they'd want to do to that... thing.<br><br>I will aid you, though, as your name is well regarded here in Atlas. Take this wand.  Once infused with the Rikti components, it should do the trick and get past the technology barrier nicely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P639859592" "You just need one more piece and then you can begin putting it together."
// RandomFameString :
"P2721814042" "I hear {Hero} has found a cure for the Lost.<em>That doesn't seem possible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P991298987" "The time has come for you to take all the pieces you've collected throughout this journey and craft them into something the world has never seen - <color orange>a cure for the Lost virus.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2800538904" "Craft Lost cure"
// SendOffString :
"P2628286269" "Here is the last piece you need before you can craft the cure. <color orange>It's something from all of the Midnighters who have fallen to the Rikti.</color> Take this, and go to a crafting station here at the University to build this Lost Curing Wand. You should have all the parts for it:<table><tr><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_Scrolls.tga><br><color orange>Circle of Thorn's Incantation</color></span></td><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_BloodSample.tga><br><color red>Vial of Hero 1's Blood</color></span></td></tr><tr><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_KheldianBloodSample.psd><br><color LightSeaGreen>Lost Serum</color></span></td><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_Fetish.tga><br><color VioletRed>Azuria's Wand</color></td></tr></span></table><span align=center><img src=salvage_ArcanePowder.tga><br><color Chocolate>Midnighter Grave Dirt</color></span>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3463926472" "You need to go to one of the invention tables here in the University and craft the Lost Curing Wand. With that you'll be able to cure the Lost of their virus. You should have all the parts for it:<table><tr><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_Scrolls.tga><br><color orange>Circle of Thorn's Incantation</color></span></td><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_BloodSample.tga><br><color red>Vial of Hero 1's Blood</color></span></td></tr><tr><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_KheldianBloodSample.psd><br><color LightSeaGreen>Lost Serum</color></span></td><td><span align=center><img src=salvage_Fetish.tga><br><color VioletRed>Azuria's Wand</color></td></tr></span></table><span align=center><img src=salvage_ArcanePowder.tga><br><color Chocolate>Midnighter Grave Dirt</color></span>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P395895804" "Montague gives something."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1564709174" "You've crafted the Lost Cure!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1963697939" "You've crafted the Lost Cure. Amazing. You up for trying it out?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1260438089" "You've got it! You've really got it! By the dark gods, you have a cure for the Lost.<br><br>A cure for the Lost! I never would have believed it possible. It's taken all of us to do this, but you specifically brought all of it together.<br><br><color orange>The Lost have been plagued for long enough. Let us put an end to that suffering.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2086351960" "Cure Lost"
// SendOffString :
"P2470866118" "The magic in the wand has only a certain amount of charges.<br><br><color orange>You might be able to cure about two dozen of them before it stops working.</color> However, that should be enough for us to get an idea of how to improve the process. If you're unsure where to go to find the Lost, I'd recommend checking out the following areas:<br><span align=center><color deepskyblue>Faultline</color><br><color deepskyblue>The Hollows</color><br><color deepskyblue>Kings Row</color><br><color deepskyblue>Perez Park</color><br><color deepskyblue>Skyway City</color></span>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2304504417" "You need to go Faultline, The Hollows, Kings Row, Perez Park or Skyway City. Those areas have the largest populations of Lost. Use the wand on them and see what happens. Hopefully, they'll be cured."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"
// tokenprogressstring :
"P452021072" "You have cured {token} of 20"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2238922809" "You've cured 20 Lost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3105543107" "Well done. You've done what no one has been able to do since the Lost first started appearing. Now I just need to work more closely with Argot'BurWot and Azuria on a way to mass produce this cure. That will take some time, but from what you've helped accomplish today, you've brought hope back to the people of Paragon City.<br><br>Thank you."
// RandomFameString :
"P3179648773" "I hear {HeroName} is the one who started curing all the Lost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NoMember Text :
"P671822989" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>You know, I've been trying to work on my Latin. I'm really truly horrible with it. Perhaps you could help me. How is your Latin?"
// Answer Text :
"P746464756" "Excello"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Question Text :
"P3519397988" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>Which phrase calls out to you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1913293383" "Quando Omni Flunkus Moritati"
// Answer Text :
"P3875922597" "Si vis pacem, para bellum"
// Answer Text :
"P2184241356" "Alea jacta est"
// Page RightAnswer Text :
"P2663455340" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>Well met, Midnighter. It is true that if one seeks to bring peace, one must also prepare for war.<br><br><color orange>Please enter the club through the door behind me.</color><br><br>We have much to discuss. You should read over this briefing on the club. It should help get you up to speed on what we're currently working on."
// Page WrongAnswer Text :
"P2227563574" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>Ah, well. Perhaps I'm not the only one who has problems with Latin.<br><br>Would you like to try again?"
// Answer Text :
"P1443913718" "Try again."
// Page MSMember Text :
"P4155060524" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>It is good to see you again, {Hero}. Please, come in. We have much to discuss."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2957481974" "With the Lost cure on its way, the Midnight Squad can begin to look at other avenues to counter the Rikti. Now that you are officially a member of the Midnight Squad, I want you to go to our club. It is a place for others like us to discuss matters of the occult and mystical arts, while also preparing for the eventuality of another Rikti attack."
// AcceptString :
"P2069339696" "Enter the Midnighter Club"
// SendOffString :
"P1873267944" "To get in, you're going to need give the password to the man at the door. He's a Latin Student we have working as an acolyte of the Midnight Squad.<br><br> As far as the password goes, we change it on a regular basis, but for now it is:<br><br><span align=center><color orange>Si vis pacem, para bellum</color></span><br><br>...oh, and welcome to the club."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3368362153" "<color deepskyblue>Epilogue</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3415684083" "Talk to Latin Student"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P498883360" "You still need to go talk to the man at the door to the Midnighter Club. Give him the pass phrase and he'll let you in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2569537253" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>You've talked to the Latin Student. Have you given him the correct pass phrase? Once you do, you should be able to get into the Midnighter Club."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P298971202" "Enter Midnighter Club"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2204061799" "You should have a look around the Midnighter Club when you get a chance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P444141375" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>Hello, {HeroName}. I'm glad you made it in here. This club has a number of interesting aspects to it. You should be able to get to Steel Canyon, Croatoa or Founders Falls from here. Take note, you will see some villains walking around as well, but do not worry. They have sworn an oath to the Midnight Squad. For now, our agenda is shared.<br><br>Again, welcome to the club. I hope you meet some interesting people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P695778327" "<color deepskyblue>Lost and Found<br>Epilogue</color><br><br>Thank you for all your assistance. From now on, I'd recommend any further discussion regarding the mystic troubles we're facing be discussed within the safety of the Midnighter Club. There is no telling who or what could be listening out here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
